 Fast 9 by the beginning of Stage 5 and look for your 5 costs. You want around 70g+ minimum for the rolldown."}]},{"id":"samyel2xyamea14","title":"Draven AD 9","compSlug":"set-18-elderwood-executioners-copy","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.493Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_Draven18"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"Fast 9","difficulty":"HARD","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_Draven18","items":["DA_Artifact_GoldCollector","DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_Fishbones"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Maokai","items":["DA_Artifact_MogulsMail","DA_Artifact_VoidGauntlet","DA_Artifact_LightshieldCrest"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_LastWhisper"},{"apiName":"DA_KrakensFury"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_LastWhisper","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Warwick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Amumu18","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Draven18","items":["DA_KrakensFury","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ivern","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":10,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kennen","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Maokai","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_BrambleVest"],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ezreal","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_LevelUp"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameSpecialist"},{"apiName":"DA_InvestedPlusPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_LuxurySubscription"},{"apiName":"DA_18_DuoQueue"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameScaling"},{"apiName":"DA_ExplosiveGrowthPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_BirthdayPresent"}],"augmentsTip":"Only play from early win streak and lots of gold. Because you are aiming for scaling 5 costs, aim to level 9 around end of Stage 4 / beginning of Stage 5. Best Draven quests are dealing damage for gold, but avoid the 10k damage in 1 round because you can get trapped.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam items aggressively and play for full win streak with Draven items. Ideal opener will be some kind of resource engine like Rengar or Blossom."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Continue prioritize win streaking. If you have an econ augment, you can go Fast 7 (before 3-3) to maintain win streak if needed."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"You can start losing rounds while focusing on econ. Fast 9 end of Stage 4 and look for the scaling 5 costs like Draven, Maokai, and Ivern. "}]},{"id":"ggxzd3j3w9knl0e","title":"Primal Jungle","compSlug":"set-18-invoker-nidalee-copy","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.482Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemHunter"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_18_EmblemHunter","DA_SteraksGage"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_BlueBuff","DA_Artifact_SilvermereDawn","DA_SteraksGage"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_InfinityEdge"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Gromp18_AP","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":20,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_KogMaw18_AD","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Krug18","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":[],"boardIndex":19,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Malphite","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_Crownguard"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_SteraksGage","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_RedBuff","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_BigGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_18_PrimalAugmentPlus_Nidalee"},{"apiName":"DA_CaretakersFavor"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_18_PrimalAugmentPlus_Sivir"},{"apiName":"DA_CarveAPath"},{"apiName":"DA_18_FOURcing"},{"apiName":"DA_DeadlierBlades"}],"augmentsTip":"Krug on the Blackthorn hex. Prioritize Nidalee > Sivir items. Kogmaw provides free Shred and Sunder. Max cap is drop riftbeasts for Gnar + Ashe + Taric. Hunter emblem is incredible on Nidalee. Can also drop Malphite for Sett + Vanguard. Take tiger primal buff.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Play around a strong AD opener around Cinderling 2 with Riftbeasts. Slam all your AD and tank items aggressively for win streak."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Comp is very Sword hungry so keep taking them off augments / carousels when possible. You can flex in 5 Riftbeast for better shops or more generic frontline."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and roll for Nidalee, Sivir, and Malphite / tank. If Malphite is too contested, consider Sentinel or Krug tank instead."}]},{"id":"cm9rvrylwohamlz","title":"Elderwood Veigar","compSlug":"set-18-veigar-consuming-flora-copy","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.130Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"1-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_BlueBuff","DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_Artifact_Dawncore"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_Artifact_LudensTempest","DA_18_EmblemFloraFatalisAugment"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_BlueBuff"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledGauntlet"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":6,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_Crownguard","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_BlueBuff","DA_HextechGunblade"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":[],"boardIndex":19,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":["DA_VoidStaff","DA_Morellonomicon"],"boardIndex":23,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Cassiopeia","items":[],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_LivingForge"},{"apiName":"DA_ForgedInStrength"},{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},{"apiName":"DA_LatentForge"},{"apiName":"DA_18_FloraFatalisAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_MissedConnections"},{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_DeadlierCaps"}],"augmentsTip":"Play with lots of copies of Ornn and Veigar, we need to hit fast to start scaling. Sacrifice Lifebloom plant to Blackthorn early. Late game you can sacrifice Leblanc 3 for big stats -> move her items to another spellweaver. After you hit rush 9 for Kobuko + Gnar. After you cash out first Ornn artifact, move items to Alistar.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Only play around this opener with early upgrades so Veigar can snowball and gain stacks. Prioritize Veigar items."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"If you are close to Veigar and Ornn 3 (7+ copies), consider rolling until you hit 3*. If far (3-4 copies), slow roll above 50g for 3*."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Once you finish Ornn 3 and Veigar 3, you can slowroll on 6 for Leblanc + Alistar 3, if you are too far push levels.. "}]},{"id":"d5xejfzkia4w1c2","title":"Caitlyn Hunters","compSlug":"set-18-caitlyn-hunters","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.134Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Caitlyn"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRagebladeRadiant"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Caitlyn","items":["DA_GuinsoosRagebladeRadiant","DA_HextechGunblade","DA_KrakensFury"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Caitlyn","items":["DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_GamblersBlade","DA_Artifact_GoldCollector"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_KrakensFury"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Caitlyn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Tristana","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sejuani","items":[],"boardIndex":15,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Caitlyn","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_KrakensFury","DA_HextechGunblade"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":["DA_SpiritVisage","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Tristana","items":[],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_LastWhisper","DA_RedBuff"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_Expedition"},{"apiName":"DA_BackupBows"},{"apiName":"DA_PrismaticTicket"},{"apiName":"DA_ShimmerscaleEssence"},{"apiName":"DA_TradeSector"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_RadiantRelic"},{"apiName":"DA_GoldenGamblePlusPlus"}],"augmentsTip":"Can also tank Sejuani 3. Tank whoever you can hit first. Can also play 4 Vanguard version with Elise. Sivir takes leftover utility / AD items (red buff highly impractical so oftentimes you play Morello). Take Turtle Primal buff. +1 or 2 tiers with radiant items (especially radiant Guinsoo).","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam Rageblade and bow items on Caitlyn for a winstreak. BIS Caitlyn is often hard to get so you can also slam items like Gunblade or Giant Slayer."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level to 6 and roll for 4 Juggernaut + 2 Hunter. Ideally upgrade Caitlyn 2 and 2 cost Juggernaut then econ up -> slow roll above 50g for 3* units."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish your 3* ideally by mid Stage 4. Level for more Hunters. Take Turtle Primal unless you are super high rolling and can take items."}]},{"id":"dp3g3imnc4cihl4","title":"Solara Yunara","compSlug":"set-18-solara-yunara","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.560Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_Artifact_Dawncore","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_LastWhisper"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_VoidStaff","DA_JeweledGauntlet"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":[],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sejuani","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_Deathblade","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_CaretakersAlly"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_SoloPlate"},{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_PrismaticTicket"},{"apiName":"DA_KickStart"}],"augmentsTip":"Prioritize 3* Yunara & Karma + 3 Blossom + LeBlanc early for clone copies. Add 3 Solar after you finish your 3* at levels 7/8 once you get 5 three stars online. Hold only 1 copy of Kayle on the bench max when rolling.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam items for Yunara and play for win streak with Blossom in. Tank Yorick / Juggernaut until you find Sejuani 2."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level at 3-2 and roll for 2* upgrades then econ up. Roll for all the 3* shown on the build + Azir. Try to avoid rolling to 0 gold because you need gold for leveling later."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish your 3* then level for 3 Solar over time. Leftover AP items on LeBlanc. Karma 3 can also hold items too."}]},{"id":"qqgynd68hkpkcqq","title":"Woodblossom","compSlug":"set-18-woodblossom","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.370Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Ezreal"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemExecutioner"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":[],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Soraka","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri","items":["DA_18_EmblemExecutioner","DA_Morellonomicon","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ezreal","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_ElderwoodTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_BodyguardTraining"},{"apiName":"DA_18_LuxAugmentII"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_Staffsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_WandOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_CommerceCore"}],"augmentsTip":"Best With executioner emblem. Focus Ezreal + Tank items first then rest on Ahri->Soraka.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with upgraded Elderwood and slam items on LeBlanc or Xayah. LeBlanc can farm copies of units on your board so avoid fielding unwanted units."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Add more Elderwood as you level with Spellweavers. If you start getting AD items, play them on Xayah / Rapidfires."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and roll heavily for Ezreal and the 4 costs, only go 9 once you have upgraded most things."}]},{"id":"xyl2tqxirk27vaa","title":"Defender Cassio","compSlug":"set-18-defender-cassio","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.560Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Cassiopeia"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemDefender"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Cassiopeia","items":["DA_Artifact_Manazane","DA_18_EmblemFloraFatalisAugment"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Cassiopeia","items":["DA_Artifact_Dawncore","DA_Artifact_BlightingJewel","DA_Artifact_EternalPact"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_HextechGunblade"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_ChainVest"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_NeedlesslyLargeRod"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Cassiopeia","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_HextechGunblade","DA_ArchangelsStaff"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":["DA_TitansResolve","DA_AdaptiveHelm","DA_Crownguard"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rammus","items":["DA_IonicSpark","DA_SunfireCape","DA_SteadfastHeart"],"boardIndex":5,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Lillia","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_Ascension"},{"apiName":"DA_18_FloraFatalisAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_SpiritOfRedemption"},{"apiName":"DA_ItsMeBaby"},{"apiName":"DA_WovenMagic"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlusPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_FlowingTears"},{"apiName":"DA_CookingPot"}],"augmentsTip":"Very BIS dependent. Can play from Coven Cashout. Can also play for Ornn 3 to potentially farm Artifacts. Always play 6 Defender. Duo carry on 8 is any 4 or 5 cost AP carry. Titans on fiddle because we have no other use for bow.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with a strong AP opener, preferably around Invokers. Karma is an example shown but you can also play Invokers or Coven lose streak."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"If lose streaking with Coven, try to kill some units each fight to preserve HP. If win streaking, push standard winstreak tempo (6 @ 3-2, 7 @ 3-5) and save econ."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Cash out / roll on level 7 for Cassio 2 / Fiddle 2. Then econ up and slow roll above 50g for 3* units. Then level to 8 for a duo carry."}]},{"id":"sjuoqjtaj14morz","title":"Yi Rengar","compSlug":"set-18-adaptor-reroll-copy","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.508Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_18_EmblemBrawler","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_EdgeOfNight"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_Artifact_WitsEnd","DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_RapidFireCannon"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_ChainVest"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Gromp18_AP","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Krug18","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_TitansResolve","DA_KrakensFury"],"boardIndex":20,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar","items":["DA_TitansResolve","DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_GuinsoosRageblade"],"boardIndex":19,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_Evenshroud"],"boardIndex":5,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_LatentForge"},{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},{"apiName":"DA_ForgedInStrength"},{"apiName":"DA_LivingForge"},{"apiName":"DA_NestingAnvils"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_LegionOfThrees"},{"apiName":"DA_18_BigGrabBag"}],"augmentsTip":"+1 tier in strength with Artifact.  VI 3 is stronger than Krug 3. Item priority: Master Yi/Rengar > Tank > Nidalee. Only take Phoenix Primal buff if ahead. Otherwise, Execute / Healing Primal. Rengar and Yi have the exact same BIS. Yi is stronger but itemize whoever is upgraded first. ","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Ideally play around a Rengar opener that can win streak. Blossom is very powerful to get early econ or item wisps."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Add more Adaptors and frontline as you go. Finish Yi/Rengar items by end of stage. You can even play 5 Blossom for maximum Wisp greed if you highroll the 4 costs."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 7 and roll for Master Yi 2, Rengar 2, and a Juggernaut Tank. Econ up and slow roll for 3*. Add Kog or a flex unit in at 8."}]},{"id":"k4p57bifqqj3aup","title":"Warwick Reroll","compSlug":"set-18-warwick-rr","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:33:53.721Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Warwick"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemBlackthorn"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Warwick","items":["DA_Artifact_Mittens","DA_TitansResolve","DA_SteraksGage"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_TitansResolve"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Murkwolf18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Warwick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":20,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Warwick","items":["DA_SteraksGage","DA_TitansResolve","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":23,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Murkwolf18","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Malphite","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_Crownguard"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Krug18","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":3}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_CaretakersAlly"},{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWaitII"},{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},{"apiName":"DA_LivingForge"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_NestingAnvils"},{"apiName":"DA_URF"},{"apiName":"DA_UrfsGrabBag"}],"augmentsTip":"Aim to play a 3* unit in the Blackthorn center hex for max stats, preferably Krug 3. Leftover AD items on Murkwolf. Can also tank Rek'sai 3 if you can't find Malphite 2.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"If you don't have Shojin, consider lose streak to guarantee it on carousel. If you have Shojin + good component, play for win streak instead."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level to 6 and roll for Warwick 2 with 4 Blackthorn + 2 Ravager. Econ up and slow roll for 3*. You can also play 4 Ravager temporarily if needed."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish Warwick 3 and push levels. If you don't have Murkwolf 3, look for Brambleback as your duo carry. "}]},{"id":"wz0a5dwezzb5rbh","title":"Riftbeast Reroll","compSlug":"set-18-riftbeast-reroll","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.430Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Sentry"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"1-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_LastWhisper"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_TearOfTheGoddess"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sentry","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_BlueBuff","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sentry","items":["DA_BlueBuff","DA_RabadonsDeathcap","DA_JeweledGauntlet"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Murkwolf18","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Krug18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_SpiritVisage"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":20,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":[],"boardIndex":19,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_RiftbeastTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_18_RiftbeastTraitAugmentStampede"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledLotus_I"},{"apiName":"DA_GlassCannon_Silver"},{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWaitII"},{"apiName":"DA_18_CaretakersAlly"},{"apiName":"DA_LuckyGlovesPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_NestingDolls"}],"augmentsTip":"Use 5 Riftbeast shops to finish your 3* because you want to rush 7 Riftbeast on Level 7 ASAP. You can carry ALL of the riftbeast carries besides Mama Beak if you have items. Krug 3 is the best tank but you can also tank Sentinel 2 > Scuttle Crab 3. Alpha Mark Cinderling early > Crab late.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam items aggressively and play for full win streak with Pebbles items. Alpha Mark Crab or Gromp."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Save up econ and try to go level 7  for 7 riftbeast on 3-5, if you're poor wait until 4-1."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Once you have your 3*, level to 8 and field 7 Riftbeast. If you can get to 9, you can ditch 1* Ravagers for Elder Dragon."}]},{"id":"xuw8bjxg94fg12i","title":"Solar Melee","compSlug":"set-18-solar-melee","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.422Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Akali_AD"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":{"apiName":"DA_EarlyLearnings"},"style":"1-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Camille","items":["DA_Artifact_Fishbones"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Akali_AD","items":["DA_Artifact_LichBane","DA_Artifact_Dawncore","DA_Artifact_RapidFireCannon"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_InfinityEdge"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Akali_AD","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Camille","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Akali_AD","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_HandOfJustice","DA_EdgeOfNight"],"boardIndex":14,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Camille","items":["DA_SteraksGage","DA_Quicksilver","DA_InfinityEdge"],"boardIndex":15,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_Crownguard","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Varus","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper","DA_InfinityEdge"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sejuani","items":[],"boardIndex":20,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_PrismaticTicket"},{"apiName":"DA_NoScoutNoPivot"},{"apiName":"DA_EarlyLearnings"},{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWait"},{"apiName":"DA_LuckyGlovesPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_SoloPlate"},{"apiName":"DA_CursedCrown"}],"augmentsTip":"Akali can be AD or AP (Flex IE/JG) Itemize Tank + 3star melee first -> 2nd melee -> Varus items. Only go for Kayle and Sej 3 with lots of money. Can  Swap out Ornn for Yorick/Rakan.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Look to play with lots of early copies of 1 cost + good reroll augment."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Roll to 30 on 3-1 level 4 for extra 1 cost copies. Then slow roll on 5 until you have 5 3 stars for solar bonus."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Make sure you keep your econ high because you need to be level 7 to fit solar on this board. Try to be Level to 7 somewhere on stage 4."}]},{"id":"43bmmt7sdohwf0d","title":"Rengar Reroll","compSlug":"set-18-rengar-rr","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.597Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar","items":["DA_Artifact_Mittens","DA_Artifact_RapidFireCannon","DA_Artifact_HellfireHatchet"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar","items":["DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_InfinityForce","DA_Artifact_TitanicHydra"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_EdgeOfNight"},{"apiName":"DA_TitansResolve"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Elise","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_EdgeOfNight"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Diana","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":7,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":["DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_SunfireCape","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":1,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_CrimsonRaptor18","items":["DA_LastWhisper","DA_KrakensFury","DA_GuinsoosRageblade"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rengar","items":["DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_TitansResolve","DA_GuinsoosRageblade"],"boardIndex":0,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":[],"boardIndex":8,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":[],"boardIndex":6,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":13,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_ChampDelivery"},{"apiName":"DA_SpeedyDoubleKill"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_TradeSector"},{"apiName":"DA_BoosterPack"},{"apiName":"DA_ExclusiveCustomization"},{"apiName":"DA_LatentForge"},{"apiName":"DA_LegionOfThrees"}],"augmentsTip":"Strong with artifacts. Rengar prefers to be paired with other carries that can use AD scaling. But he is a flexible unit with no traits so you can play him with whatever you hit.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Only play this comp with an early Rengar with items so you can snowball Rival. Play any upgraded frontline tank to stall for Kha'zix."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"If you have a few crucial pairs on level 6, you can consider rolling slightly on 6 to get charms / upgrade units. Econ up to 7 otherwise."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Slow roll on 7 for 3* upgrades on whatever 3 costs you're chasing. In this example, if you can't hit Mama Beak 3, look for Aphelios duo instead."}]},{"id":"9pb3hm3rsvrwybi","title":"Solar Kayle","compSlug":"set-18-solar-kayle","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.459Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":["DA_Artifact_WitsEnd","DA_Artifact_StatikkShiv","DA_Artifact_Mittens"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":["DA_Artifact_RapidFireCannon","DA_Item_Artifact_TalismanOfAscension","DA_Artifact_ZhonyasParadox"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_NeedlesslyLargeRod"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sejuani","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Leona","items":[],"boardIndex":11,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_SpiritVisage"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_RedBuff","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sejuani","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_RabadonsDeathcap"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_SolarTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_PrismaticTicket"},{"apiName":"DA_NoScoutNoPivot"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_MissedConnections"},{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},{"apiName":"DA_18_ElderwoodTraitAugment"}],"augmentsTip":"Roll on 3-1 to try and finish a 3* 1 cost for bench space -> Slow roll above 50g on level 5. Ornn Artifact print is very strong but only scales quickly once you get him to 3*. Kayle has built in 20% Shred at 2*. ","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Ideally open with Kayle and upgraded Ornn. After Rageblade, prioritize tank items on Ornn so he can begin reliably stacking Artifact scaling."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Bench priority: Kayle 3 > Ornn 3 > Xayah / Leona > Sejuani > Rakan. Once you finish 1 costs, move up to level 6 for 2 costs."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish your 3* and level for Elderwood. Cap with any 5 costs like Lux, Ivern, Taric, etc."}]},{"id":"ncbuf2xodxhcgjw","title":"Teemowood","compSlug":"set-18-sprykin-teemo-copy","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.482Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_VoidStaff"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_NeedlesslyLargeRod"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":15,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":["DA_VoidStaff","DA_Morellonomicon","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWaitII"},{"apiName":"DA_18_CaretakersAlly"},{"apiName":"DA_DeadlierCaps"},{"apiName":"DA_18_SprykinAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_SoloPlate"},{"apiName":"DA_TradeSector"},{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_NoScoutNoPivot"}],"augmentsTip":"Best with winstreak opener around Leblanc or Teemo with Brawler frontline.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with a win streak Teemo start and itemize him ASAP. The more Teemo casts, the more likely you can collect value off his mushrooms."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level to 6 and roll for your 2* upgrades to stabilize and win streak Stage 3. Econ up and slow roll above 50g for 3*."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish Teemo 3* and your tank then push levels for more Invokers. If you get more damage items late game Morgana can hold the utility."}]},{"id":"o9jvqx283oovfzr","title":"Invoker Nidalee","compSlug":"set-18-adaptor-nidalee","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.157Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Morgana","items":["DA_Artifact_BlightingJewel"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_StatikkShiv"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledGauntlet"},{"apiName":"DA_Morellonomicon"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kayle","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_GuinsoosRageblade"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Sentry","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_KogMaw18_AD","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":[],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Morgana","items":["DA_Morellonomicon","DA_ArchangelsStaff","DA_AdaptiveHelm"],"boardIndex":9,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_AdaptiveHelm"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_WandOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_SpeedyDoubleKill"},{"apiName":"DA_Staffsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_18_BigGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_18_PrimalAugmentPlus_Nidalee"},{"apiName":"DA_CaretakersFavor"},{"apiName":"DA_BuriedTreasuresIII"},{"apiName":"DA_TimeSkip"}],"augmentsTip":"Prioritize Nidalee > Morello on Morgana + Tank > leftover AP on Morgana. Riftbeast Alpha Mark the Scuttle Crab. Kogmaw provides free Sunder / Shred. Take tiger primal buff.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Play any strong Rageblade opener on an AP carry such as Kayle, Master Yi, or a Spellweaver. Opener is very flexible."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Comp is very Rod hungry so keep taking them off augments / carousels when possible. If you are not playing Invokers, hold onto cheap units like Pebbles for later."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and roll for 4 Invoker. Avoid tunneling only on 4 Vanguard frontline. You can also flex Brawlers or Juggernauts as needed."}]},{"id":"jmidj8nhh80594c","title":"Trait Ladder","compSlug":"set-18-trait-ladder","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.482Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":{"apiName":"DA_TraitLadder"},"style":"Fast 9","difficulty":"HARD","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Varus","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_KhaZix","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":20,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap"],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Diana","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_KhaZix","items":["DA_18_EmblemSlayer"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_SunfireCape","DA_SpiritVisage"],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_KrakensFury","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_TraitLadder"},{"apiName":"DA_Coronation"},{"apiName":"DA_CursedCrown"},{"apiName":"DA_MagicRoll"},{"apiName":"DA_UrfsGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_URF"},{"apiName":"DA_SpreadingRootsPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_18_BranchingOutPlus"}],"augmentsTip":"Hard flex composition, but very strong when played well. Any emblem start is fine. Get Khazix 10 takedowns for ravager evolution while gathering the early 2-8 trait cashouts in the midgame. The key interval to plan for is 10 traits for the Tactician Crown -> pivot to legendaries or go for even more cashouts if healthy.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Ideally start with Khazix to get 10 takedowns ASAP. Add in the cheap 1-2 cost units to activate traits. Otherwise, flex around your best upgraded unit."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Continue adding and flexing in more traits. +1 team size augments like Coronation or Cursed Crown are very OP here."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"After you hit 10 traits, add Amumu with the Tactician's Crown you get and then level for Kennen. Then pivot to 5 costs at level 9."}]},{"id":"lskq0yo5kvzfrfj","title":"Inferno Fast 9","compSlug":"set-18-inferno-fast-9","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.434Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_Lux18_Base"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemInferno"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"HARD","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_InfinityEdge"},{"apiName":"DA_WarmogsArmor"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_RedBuff","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Akali_AD","items":[],"boardIndex":7,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Lillia","items":["DA_ProtectorsVow"],"boardIndex":6,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir","items":["DA_LastWhisper","DA_InfinityEdge"],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Amumu18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_BrambleVest","DA_DragonsClaw"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ashe","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RedBuff","DA_18_EmblemInferno"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kennen","items":["DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_Bloodthirster","DA_Quicksilver"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Lux18_Base","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap","DA_JeweledGauntlet"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_BigGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_CyberneticUplink_Gold"},{"apiName":"DA_CommerceCore"},{"apiName":"DA_SpreadingRoots"},{"apiName":"DA_TheTraitTree"},{"apiName":"DA_BoxingLessons"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameScaling"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameSpecialist"}],"augmentsTip":"Only play with Inferno emblem. Ideally needs Inferno Lux to be super strong but can top 4 without Lux / only Inferno Emblem Ashe. Can also play more frontline instead of 7 inferno or Hunter (Taric/4 Juggernaut).","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with a strong AD opener, preferably around Yunara. Slam generic AD items and Tank items for a win streak. You can also play around Varus/Akali 2 with AD items."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level and add more Juggernauts and Executioners. Make sure to hold Inferno units along the way. Can also play 3 Inferno for shop high rolls."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Roll on 8 for 5 inferno Sivir + Vi + Lillia + Hunter (can play Tristana before Ashe). When you find Ashe make sure to give her inferno emblem + shojin."}]},{"id":"h67mfu31g8x3mw1","title":"Veigar Consuming Flora","compSlug":"set-18-dark-mages","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.430Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemFloraFatalisAugment"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"1-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_BlueBuff","DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_Artifact_Dawncore"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_Artifact_LudensTempest","DA_18_EmblemFloraFatalisAugment"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_BlueBuff"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledGauntlet"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_BlueBuff"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_BlueBuff","DA_18_EmblemFloraFatalisAugment"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":[],"boardIndex":24,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rammus","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":[],"boardIndex":19,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":[],"boardIndex":15,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_LivingForge"},{"apiName":"DA_ForgedInStrength"},{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},{"apiName":"DA_LatentForge"},{"apiName":"DA_18_FloraFatalisAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_MissedConnections"},{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_DeadlierCaps"}],"augmentsTip":"Very strong with Dawncore and Ludens as well. Sacrifice a 3* unit for maximum Blackthorn stats.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Only play around this opener with early upgrades so Veigar can snowball and gain stacks. Prioritize Veigar items."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"If you are close to Veigar 3 (7+ copies), consider rolling until you hit 3*. If far (3-4 copies), slow roll above 50g for 3*."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Once you finish your 3*, push levels for more Spyrkin, Blackthorn, or Brawlers. "}]},{"id":"5e5ew38rzm7ai9v","title":"Emblem Rengar","compSlug":"set-18-fae-tristana-copy","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.578Z","mainChampi