s."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Keep snowballing with Rengar. Take an item augment if you aren't on track to get 3 items by end of Stage. Rengar only performs as well as your best tank so prioritize frontline too."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 7 and roll above 50g for 3* Rengar and 3* Rammus. Use your 4 Fae cash outs to push levels. Tristana takes leftover items."}]},{"id":"ch3n2dmp7zth0y6","title":"Ravager Elise","compSlug":"set-18-infinite-elise","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.491Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Elise"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemSlayer"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Elise","items":["DA_18_EmblemSlayer","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_TitansResolve"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Elise","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_TitansResolve"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_TitansResolve"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_NegatronCloak"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_ChainVest"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Camille","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Caitlyn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Elise","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Diana","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Camille","items":[],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Murkwolf18","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":16,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Elise","items":["DA_TitansResolve","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_ArchangelsStaff"],"boardIndex":7,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":[],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Diana","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_StrikersFlail","DA_HandOfJustice"],"boardIndex":8,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Morgana","items":["DA_VoidStaff","DA_Morellonomicon"],"boardIndex":15,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_CovenTraitAugment_LootToAP"},{"apiName":"DA_18_CovenTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWaitII"},{"apiName":"DA_CookingPot"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_SoloPlate"},{"apiName":"DA_Staffsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_Expedition"}],"augmentsTip":"Very strong with Ravager emblem. If no emblem, can play standard 4 Vanguard Coven and flex the last spots. Elise can also play Stoneplate Gargoyle instead of Archangels for a more defensive-heavy build.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Ideally open with Coven and start gathering Essence. It is actually better to win early than lose for stacks so don't overly force lose streak."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level to 6 and roll for a Elise 2, Covens, and another Ravager. If AD items, look for Murkwolf. If AP items, look for Dianas."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Cash out Coven with at least 2-3 lives (25-30 hp). Finish Elise 3 then level for more Vanguards, Coven, or Lunar / 5 costs."}]},{"id":"hl39j8m4hzxr7ly","title":"Fae Tristana","compSlug":"set-18-sprykin-trist","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.430Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Tristana"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemFae"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Tristana","items":["DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_HextechGunblade"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Varus","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":15,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rammus","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_SpiritVisage","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Tristana","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_HextechGunblade","DA_GiantSlayer"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Lillia","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir","items":["DA_18_EmblemFae","DA_LastWhisper","DA_RedBuff"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_URF"},{"apiName":"DA_UrfsGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_18_BranchingOut"},{"apiName":"DA_18_BranchingOutPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_SpreadingRoots"},{"apiName":"DA_SpreadingRootsPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlusPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"}],"augmentsTip":"Only play when you have Fae emblem. Stacking 4 Fae ASAP is important so you can get a gold engine. Can also tank Vi primary if you can't find Rammus. Execute Primal > Item Primal unless very far ahead / win streaking.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Play for win streak with upgraded Rageblade holder. Start stacking Fae since getting to 7 ASAP is crucial for success."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Itemize and play Tristana as soon as you find her. Sprykin is more important than Hunter. If you spike very early Primal from ahead, you can consider items."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 7 and roll above 50g for 3* Tristana and Rammus. Use your 4 Fae cash outs to push levels. Give Sivir leftover AD items."}]},{"id":"aqgxioqdlyuamd3","title":"Unrivaled Reroll","compSlug":"set-18-unrivaled-reroll","tier":"X","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.604Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_KhaZix"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_EdgeOfNight"},"mainAugment":{"apiName":"DA_18_RivalsAugment"},"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"CONDITIONAL","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_EdgeOfNight"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"D