ts. Once you finish 3* tank + Khazix 3 / Rengar 3, add 5 costs."}]},{"id":"mttbzj0vu4ebnvf","title":"Elderwood Executioners","compSlug":"set-18-elderwood-executioners","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.436Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Ezreal"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemExecutioner"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_LeBlanc","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_VoidStaff"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":[],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ezreal","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Soraka","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap","DA_VoidStaff"],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Lux18_Base","items":["DA_18_EmblemExecutioner","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":6,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":["DA_DragonsClaw","DA_BrambleVest","DA_SunfireCape"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_ElderwoodTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_BodyguardTraining"},{"apiName":"DA_18_LuxAugmentII"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_Staffsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_WandOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_CommerceCore"}],"augmentsTip":"Look for Elderwood Lux. 3 Executioner is a big spike so always look to play around it if possible. Can also chase 9 Elderwood if you have Elderwood Lux.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with upgraded Elderwood and slam items on LeBlanc or Xayah. LeBlanc can farm copies of units on your board so avoid fielding unwanted units."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Add more Elderwood as you level with Spellweavers. If you start getting AD items, play them on Xayah / Rapidfires."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and look for Ezreal and Soraka with 7 Elderwood. Try not to roll to 0g because we need gold to get to level 9."}]},{"id":"oaeid9p1u7zaqx9","title":"Spirit Blossom","compSlug":"set-18-spirit-blossom","tier":"A","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.438Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemBlossom"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri","items":["DA_18_EmblemExecutioner","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledGauntlet"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":[],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir","items":[],"boardIndex":24,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Zyra","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":["DA_BrambleVest","DA_DragonsClaw","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ashe","items":["DA_RedBuff","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_Slammin"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledLotus_I"},{"apiName":"DA_CommerceCore"},{"apiName":"DA_18_BigGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_FeelingLucky"},{"apiName":"DA_ExclusiveCustomization"},{"apiName":"DA_Staffsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_18_WispRebatePlus"}],"augmentsTip":"Core of the comp is Ahri + Sett + Ashe. The rest of the units are flexible. If itemizing Sivir, go for Execute Primal. If far ahead and win streaking, you can play for Phoenix Primal.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Look for 3 Blossom early and play for win streak. Karma can hold items for Ahri. Itemize Yorick or any other 2* tank."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Add 5 Blossom when you can. Flex in Blackthorn (Veigar / Azir), Fiddlesticks + Defender, or other frontline while stacking econ. Always play Ahri 1 and itemize her."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level and roll for Ahri, Sett, and at least 5 Blossom. You can also temporarily play 7 Blossom for econ while going to 9. End game cap = replace Yorick / Karma."}]},{"id":"5h907plrevg86ak","title":"Ashe Fast 9 ","compSlug":"set-18-blossom-fast-9","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:52.849Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Ashe"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"Fast 9","difficulty":"HARD","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_LastWhisper"},{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_RedBuff"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Amumu18","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_SpiritVisage","DA_SteadfastHeart"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kennen","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ashe","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RedBuff","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_ElderDragon","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_SteraksGage","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":19,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_LevelUp"},{"apiName":"DA_HedgeFund"},{"apiName":"DA_LuxurySubscription"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameSpecialist"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameScaling"},{"apiName":"DA_PatientStudy"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"}],"augmentsTip":"Prioritize Ashe items > Tank items > leftover duo carry items (ideally Elder Dragon). Comp is very expensive so make sure you take good econ augments. ","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam items aggressively and play around 3 Blossom for a win streak. This is a comp you can only play from far ahead with lots of HP and resources."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Continue your win streak. Pick an econ augment if you have not already. Otherwise, take item augments and push levels."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"If you have 80+ HP, you can consider losing Stage 4 and focus purely on economy. Aim to Fast 9 by end of Stage 4 / 5-1 and transition your board."}]},{"id":"nka7oiom5y8dpqi","title":"Adaptor Reroll","compSlug":"set-18-adaptor-reroll","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.513Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_18_EmblemBrawler","DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_EdgeOfNight"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_Artifact_WitsEnd","DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_RapidFireCannon"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_GuinsoosRageblade"},{"apiName":"DA_EdgeOfNight"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_ChainVest"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Gromp18_AP","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Krug18","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_KogMaw18_AD","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap","DA_JeweledGauntlet"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_MasterYi_AD","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_TitansResolve"],"boardIndex":20,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_GargoyleStoneplate"],"boardIndex":5,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_LatentForge"},{"apiName":"DA_PortableForge"},{"apiName":"DA_ForgedInStrength"},{"apiName":"DA_LivingForge"},{"apiName":"DA_URF"},{"apiName":"DA_NestingAnvils"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_LegionOfThrees"}],"augmentsTip":"+1 tier in strength with Artifact or Brawler emblem. Level 7 board is no Gromp. VI 3 is stronger than Krug 3, but harder to hit because of Vi's popularity. Item priority: Master Yi > Tank > Kogmaw > Nidalee. Only take Phoenix Primal buff if ahead. Otherwise, Execute / Healing Primal.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Ideally play around a Master Yi opener that can win streak. Blossom is very powerful to get early econ or item wisps."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Add more Adaptors and frontline as you go. Finish Yi items by end of stage. You can even play 5 Blossom for maximum Wisp greed if you highroll the 4 costs."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 7 and roll for Master Yi 2, Kogmaw 2, and a Juggernaut Tank. Econ up and slow roll for 3*. Add Gromp or a flex unit in at 8."}]},{"id":"32tqzqboq6ap171","title":"Sprykin Teemo","compSlug":"set-18-sprykin-teemo","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.464Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemSprykin"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"EASY","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_RabadonsDeathcap"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_NeedlesslyLargeRod"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rammus","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Fiddlesticks18","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Veigar","items":[],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Teemo","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RabadonsDeathcap","DA_JeweledGauntlet"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_KogMaw18_AD","items":["DA_Morellonomicon"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Kobuko","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":["DA_18_EmblemSprykin","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":3}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWaitII"},{"apiName":"DA_18_CaretakersAlly"},{"apiName":"DA_DeadlierCaps"},{"apiName":"DA_18_SprykinAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_SoloPlate"},{"apiName":"DA_TradeSector"},{"apiName":"DA_URF"},{"apiName":"DA_UrfsGrabBag"}],"augmentsTip":"Best with Sprykin emblem and lots of copies of Teemo early. Sacrifice a 3* unit (ideally Kobuko) to give Rek'Sai big stats. Can also tank Rammus 3 if very rich / high rolling. Kog'maw provides free Shred / Sunder.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with a win streak Teemo start and itemize him ASAP. The more Teemo casts, the more likely you can collect value off his mushrooms."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level to 6 and roll for your 2* upgrades to stabilize and win streak Stage 3. Econ up and slow roll above 50g for 3*."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish Teemo 3* and your tank then push levels for more Sprykins. Cap the board with Gnar or another 5 cost."}]},{"id":"3s628k9w9qsh8mw","title":"Moo-nara","compSlug":"set-18-moo-nara","tier":"C","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.563Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"2-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_Artifact_Dawncore","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_Deathblade"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Alistar","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_SpiritVisage","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":4,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_Deathblade","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":27,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ezreal","items":["DA_LastWhisper","DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_RedBuff"],"boardIndex":26,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_Lifeblossom","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":[],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Elderwood18_StonebarkTree","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_WorththeWaitII"},{"apiName":"DA_18_CaretakersAlly"},{"apiName":"DA_KickStart"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_GlassCannon_Silver"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_SoloPlate"}],"augmentsTip":"Play when you have lots of copies of Yunara with sword items. Leftover AD on Ezreal. Can also play 3* Leblanc / Ahri 2* as an AP duo carry if you have the items for it. Play Azir + Reksai on 6 before you find Ezreal + Sett. Level for more executioners.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam items for Yunara and play for win streak with Blossom in. Tank Yorick / Juggernaut until you find Alistar."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Level at 3-2 and roll for 2* upgrades then econ up. The level 6 board plays Azir + Rek'Sai until you find Sett / Ezreal. Skip Azir 2, too expensive."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Finish your 3* then level for Executioners. Your biggest spike is 3 Executioner, but Kennen caps your board. Gnar is nice but not important."}]},{"id":"0r6d7771fy8zjze","title":"10 Riftbeast","compSlug":"set-18-10-riftbeast","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.141Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_ElderDragon"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"Fast 9","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_InfinityEdge"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":["DA_InfinityEdge"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sentry","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Sentry","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Gromp18_AP","items":[],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Murkwolf18","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":1,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Krug18","items":[],"boardIndex":0,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_CrimsonRaptor18","items":[],"boardIndex":25,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":["DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_Quicksilver","DA_GiantSlayer"],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_Crownguard"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_GnarSmall","items":["DA_ThiefsGloves"],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_ElderDragon","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_StrikersFlail","DA_Deathblade"],"boardIndex":17,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_RiftbeastTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_18_RiftbeastTraitAugmentStampede"},{"apiName":"DA_Coronation"},{"apiName":"DA_LevelUp"},{"apiName":"DA_LateGameSpecialist"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_ExplosiveGrowthPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_CursedCrown"}],"augmentsTip":"Alpha Mark the Elder Dragon. Strong with any augment that gives you +1 team size so you can fit in another carry.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Slam items aggressively and play for full win streak with Riftbeast items. Ideal opener will be Riftbeasts featuring Cinderling / Gromp / Mama Beak carry."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Continue prioritize win streaking. If you have an econ augment, you can go Fast 7 (before 3-3) to maintain win streak if needed."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"You can start losing rounds while focusing on econ. Fast 9 by the beginning of Stage 5 and look for your 5 costs. You want around 70g+ minimum for the rolldown."}]},{"id":"5cfl815ifyb2qbx","title":"Aphelios Rapidfire","compSlug":"set-18-aphelios-rapidfire","tier":"A","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.133Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemRapidfire"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":["DA_Artifact_GoldCollector"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_ChainVest"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Varus","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Varus","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":[],"boardIndex":23,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_CrimsonRaptor18","items":["DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_ProtectorsVow"],"boardIndex":9,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Amumu18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_BrambleVest"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_KrakensFury","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":["DA_18_EmblemRapidfire","DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_Quicksilver"],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_CarveAPath"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_BacklineBlueprint"},{"apiName":"DA_CookingPot"},{"apiName":"DA_SpreadingRoots"},{"apiName":"DA_TheTraitTree"},{"apiName":"DA_FutureFocused"}],"augmentsTip":"Only strong with +1 Rapidfire, play another version if you have it. Don't need much attack speed with 5 rapidfire.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with a strong win streak AD tempo around Rapidfires. All ad items are good slams besides rageblade."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Comp can use many items so take item augment if you don't have one yet. Mama Beak can be a strong carry here if you have Riftbeasts online."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and roll heavily for Aphelios and the 4 costs. Only push for 9 once you have almost all your 4 costs upgraded. "}]},{"id":"32ck7w12n2zqknv","title":"Primal Flex","compSlug":"set-18-primal-jungle-copy","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.413Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir"},"mainItem":{"apiName":"DA_18_EmblemHunter"},"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_SpearOfShojin","DA_18_EmblemHunter","DA_SteraksGage"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_BlueBuff","DA_Artifact_SilvermereDawn","DA_SteraksGage"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_InfinityEdge"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Gromp18_AP","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Cinderling18","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Scuttlecrab18","items":[],"boardIndex":4,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_KogMaw18_AD","items":[],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_ProtectorsVow"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Amumu18","items":["DA_WarmogsArmor","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_BrambleVest"],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Nidalee18_AP","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_SteraksGage","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":14,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sivir","items":["DA_InfinityEdge","DA_RedBuff","DA_StrikersFlail"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":5,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_18_BigGrabBag"},{"apiName":"DA_18_PrimalAugmentPlus_Nidalee"},{"apiName":"DA_CaretakersFavor"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_18_PrimalAugmentPlus_Sivir"},{"apiName":"DA_CarveAPath"},{"apiName":"DA_18_FOURcing"},{"apiName":"DA_DeadlierBlades"}],"augmentsTip":"Just a small variation on the malphite board, play Amumu + Vanguard over Blackthorn/Brawler. Prioritize Nidalee > Sivir items. Kogmaw provides free Shred and Sunder. Max cap is drop riftbeasts for Maokai + Ashe + Kennen. Hunter emblem is incredible on Nidalee. Take tiger primal buff.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Play around a strong AD opener around Cinderling 2 with Riftbeasts. Slam all your AD and tank items aggressively for win streak."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Comp is very Sword hungry so keep taking them off augments / carousels when possible. You can flex in 5 Riftbeast for better shops or more generic frontline."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and roll for Nidalee, Sivir, and Amumu/Sentinel. Buy Hecarim on Rolldown as well if you miss taric and itemize him over 1 star 4 costs."}]},{"id":"gl6aeweqxikso1q","title":"Azir Reroll","compSlug":"set-18-azir-reroll","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.111Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"3-Cost Reroll","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":["DA_Artifact_SeekersArmguard","DA_Artifact_NavoriFlickerblade","DA_Artifact_EternalPact"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_HextechGunblade"},{"apiName":"DA_GargoyleStoneplate"},{"apiName":"DA_ArchangelsStaff"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_NeedlesslyLargeRod"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_KhaZix","items":[],"boardIndex":17,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Azir","items":["DA_ArchangelsStaff","DA_HextechGunblade","DA_JeweledGauntlet"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_RekSai","items":[],"boardIndex":19,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":18,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Vi18","items":["DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_GargoyleStoneplate","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":3},{"apiName":"DA_18_Sett","items":[],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":["DA_VoidStaff"],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_ChampDelivery"},{"apiName":"DA_PandorasBench"},{"apiName":"DA_AdvancedLoanPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_HeroicGrabBagPlusPlus"},{"apiName":"DA_LegionOfThrees"},{"apiName":"DA_PrismaticTicket"},{"apiName":"DA_BlackthornTraitAugment"},{"apiName":"DA_ArcaneViktory"}],"augmentsTip":"More of an Azir comp than a Khazix comp, we just want executioner buff than we feed Kha to blackthorn hex for offensive Azir Stacks. If you have lots of Kha upgrades drop Sett + Reksai for Ahri + WW/Malphite for Spellweaver+Ravager. With enough mana gen from blackthorn, Azir doesn't need attack speed, but Rageblade is okay on him.","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Try to angle this comp with early Azir ideally with blossom opener for better charms."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"If you have a few crucial pairs on level 6, you can consider rolling slightly on 6 to get charms / upgrade units. Econ up to 7 otherwise."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Make sure you have 2* Azir, Kha and Vi on 4-1, then slowroll above 50 for 3 stars. Make sure Kha has 8 takedowns before feeding to blackthorn, 3 executioner is very important."}]},{"id":"vz81ruankglv606","title":"Aphelios Vanguards","compSlug":"set-18-moon-fire","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.132Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":["DA_Artifact_GoldCollector"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":["DA_GuinsoosRageblade","DA_InfinityEdge","DA_KrakensFury"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_Component_RecurveBow"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_BFSword"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_SparringGloves"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_ChainVest"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ornn","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Varus","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Xayah","items":["DA_LastWhisper","DA_RedBuff"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Shen","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Diana","items":[],"boardIndex":9,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Hecarim","items":[],"boardIndex":10,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_CrimsonRaptor18","items":["DA_LastWhisper"],"boardIndex":22,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Zyra","items":[],"boardIndex":27,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Aphelios","items":["DA_RedBuff","DA_Deathblade","DA_GiantSlayer"],"boardIndex":21,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Brambleback18","items":["DA_EdgeOfNight","DA_Quicksilver","DA_SteraksGage"],"boardIndex":8,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1}],"augments":[{"apiName":"DA_BackupBows"},{"apiName":"DA_OneBuffTwoBuff"},{"apiName":"DA_Swordsmith"},{"apiName":"DA_CarveAPath"},{"apiName":"DA_SwordOverflow"},{"apiName":"DA_CaretakersFavor"},{"apiName":"DA_BuriedTreasuresIII"},{"apiName":"DA_18_FOURcing"}],"augmentsTip":"Core units are Aphelios + Diana + Sentinel + Mama Beak. Red Buff is BIS Aphelios but you can also play Rageblade build. Play Scuttlecrab + Rakan over Brambleback if no melee items. Can duo carry Zyra or Morgana if extra AP items. ","tips":[{"stage":"Stage 2","tip":"Open with a strong win streak AD tempo around Rapidfires. BIS is somewhat fake in this comp so slam aggressively to win."},{"stage":"Stage 3","tip":"Comp can use many items so take item augment if you don't have one yet. Mama Beak can be a strong carry here if you have Riftbeasts online."},{"stage":"Stage 4","tip":"Level to 8 and roll heavily for Aphelios and the 4 costs. Only push for 9 once you have almost all your 4 costs upgraded. "}]},{"id":"zwyl48qgfldzqq8","title":"Coven Ahri","compSlug":"set-18-coven-ahri","tier":"B","set":18,"updated":"2026-09-30 21:31:53.080Z","mainChampion":{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri"},"mainItem":null,"mainAugment":null,"style":"4-Cost Fast 8","difficulty":"MEDIUM","altBuilds":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri","items":["DA_18_EmblemInvoker","DA_Artifact_Manazane"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Morgana","items":["DA_Artifact_BlightingJewel","DA_18_EmblemSpellweaver"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"carousel":[{"apiName":"DA_SpearOfShojin"},{"apiName":"DA_JeweledGauntlet"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_GiantsBelt"},{"apiName":"DA_Component_TearOfTheGoddess"}],"earlyComp":[{"apiName":"DA_18_Rakan","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yorick","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Karma18","items":["DA_JeweledGauntlet","DA_SpearOfShojin"],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Yunara","items":[],"boardIndex":null,"stars":1}],"finalComp":[{"apiName":"DA_Sentinel18","items":["DA_Crownguard","DA_ProtectorsVow","DA_WarmogsArmor"],"boardIndex":3,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_Taric18","items":[],"boardIndex":2,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Morgana","items":["DA_VoidStaff","DA_Morellonomicon"],"boardIndex":16,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Diana","items":[],"boardIndex":9,"stars":1},{"apiName":"DA_18_Ahri","items":["DA_JeweledGaun